  "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Which expression is equivalent to <math alttext=\"23 x cubed plus 2 x squared plus 9 x\"><mrow>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>23</mn>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>3</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t<msup>\n\t\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t\t\t<mn>2</mn>\n\t\t</msup>\n\t</mrow>\n\t<mo>+</mo>\n\t<mrow>\n\t\t<mn>9</mn>\n\t\t<mi>x</mi>\n\t</mrow>\n</mrow>\n</math>?</p>",
