  "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is correct. Since <math alttext=\"x\"><mi>x</mi>\n</math> is a common factor of each term in the given expression, the given expression can be rewritten as <math alttext=\"x left parenthesis 23 x squared plus 2 x plus 9 right parenthesis\"><mi>x</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>23</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This expression is equivalent to <math alttext=\"23 x cubed plus 46 x squared plus 207 x\"><mn>23</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>46</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>207</mn><mi>x</mi></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is incorrect. This expression is equivalent to <math alttext=\"207 x Superscript 4 plus 18 x cubed plus 9 x\"><mn>207</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>x</mi></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect. This expression is equivalent to <math alttext=\"34 x cubed plus 34 x squared plus 34 x\"><mn>34</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>34</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>34</mn><mi>x</mi></math>.</p>",
